  "description": "A comprehensive .NET library for correcting OCR errors in English text with ~837 battle-tested patterns. Specifically designed for Tesseract PGS subtitle extraction, achieving 100% success rate on tested corpus. Handles capital I/lowercase l confusion, spacing errors, apostrophe issues, and number/letter confusion. Zero false positives, modular architecture, multi-pass processing.",
