  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0: Production-ready release with ~837 comprehensive patterns for English OCR correction. Tested on 7,164 subtitles across 6 feature films with 100% success rate and zero false positives. Includes modular pattern organization (NumberPatterns, ApostrophePatterns), multi-pass processing, detailed logging, and performance optimizations. Perfect for Tesseract PGS subtitle extraction workflows.",
